Constant Grade

Creates a straight terrain path with a fixed slope. Drag from the start tile to the end tile to set the path direction and length; dragging sideways widens the affected path. The preview shows the resulting start and end heights before applying.

Controls: release the mouse to apply the grade. Alt+Scroll changes the target grade from downhill to uphill, and Ctrl+Scroll toggles side smoothing. Side smoothing blends the path edges into nearby terrain; turning it off keeps harder edges. Press Esc to cancel.
